{"id":"6730349967b8ffce","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-algebra.md","title":"Algebra","display":"df-algebra — Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-algebra","aliases":["93-df-algebra"],"display":"df-algebra — Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebra — Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a similarity-type candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbf A|\">\\(|\\mathbf A|\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathbf A}\">\\(f^{\\mathbf A}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A)\\)</span> are the carrier, operation-family, operation-graph, and nullary-operation-value projections defined here.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n|\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle|&amp;\\coloneqq A_0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf o,\\\\\nf^{\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf o(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n|\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle|&amp;\\coloneqq A_0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf o,\\\\\nf^{\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf o(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle)\n\\coloneqq\\mathbf o(f)(\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle)\n\\coloneqq\\mathbf o(f)(\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists A_0\\;\\exists\\mathbf o\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land A_0\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A=\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf o:S\\to V\n\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf o(f):A_0^{\\alpha(f)}\\to A_0\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists A_0\\;\\exists\\mathbf o\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land A_0\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A=\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathbf o:S\\to V\n\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf o(f):A_0^{\\alpha(f)}\\to A_0\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land f\\in S\\land\\alpha(f)=0\n\\to\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A)\\in|\\mathbf A|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land f\\in S\\land\\alpha(f)=0\n\\to\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A)\\in|\\mathbf A|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The equality <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is part of the formula, and the algebra code stores an explicit operation-family function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf o\">\\(\\mathbf o\\)</span>. A nullary interpretation is still a function graph on the singleton <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0^0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(A_0^0=\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\\)</span> extracts its unique carrier value instead of identifying the graph with that value.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbf A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n|\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle|&\\coloneqq A_0,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Op}_{93}(\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\mathbf o,\\\\\nf^{\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle}&\\coloneqq\\mathbf o(f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle)\n\\coloneqq\\mathbf o(f)(\\varnothing)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists A_0\\;\\exists\\mathbf o\\;\\Bigl[{}&\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land A_0\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathbf A=\\langle A_0,\\mathbf o\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land\\mathbf o:S\\to V\n\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\bigl(\\mathbf o(f):A_0^{\\alpha(f)}\\to A_0\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land f\\in S\\land\\alpha(f)=0\n\\to\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(f;\\mathbf A)\\in|\\mathbf A|","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf o","display":false},{"tex":"A_0^0=\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}","display":false}],"bytes":2083,"backlinks":[{"id":"3296916b733e08cd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2cd98554615471be","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\in V$, $I\\ne\\varnothing$, $\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)$, and $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]]."},{"id":"e2be868cf664b716","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]]."},{"id":"bd15b0d34ad7970a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d541ac78ed69cf9f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]]."},{"id":"18ca772ab524a46f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"c